OL,3,GNEWSA#700k support package for Lough
OL,4,ANeagh eel fishers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA financial package to support eel
OL,7,Ffishers on Lough Neagh has been
OL,8,Funveiled. A small number of specialist
OL,9,Fhauliers will also be eligible.
OL,11,FIt follows the closure of the
OL,12,Fyellow/brown eel fishery, announced
OL,13,Fearlier this year.
OL,15,FThe #700,000 Lough Neagh Eel Fishery
OL,16,FTransition Scheme will run for three
OL,17,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
