OL,3,GNEWSA#700k support package for Lough
OL,4,ANeagh eel fishers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Agriculture, Environment and Rural
OL,7,FAffairs Minister, Andrew Muir, said it
OL,8,Fwas designed to support a long-term
OL,9,Fsustainable industry while conserving
OL,10,Feel stocks, which have been in decline
OL,11,Fsince the early eighties.
